[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25922.788, "timestamp": "07:12:02", "text": "太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25925.67, "timestamp": "07:12:05", "text": "煩人了。但是，等等。我點了什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25953.67, "timestamp": "07:12:33", "text": "這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25965.99, "timestamp": "07:12:45", "text": "不是。為什麼它藏得這麼隱密？哦，你從這裡看。好吧。笨蛋。你好，胸部。對。在想更好的辦法揍她媽媽。親愛的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25971.99, "timestamp": "07:12:51", "text": "他們真的需要揍那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25976.39, "timestamp": "07:12:56", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25979.27, "timestamp": "07:12:59", "text": "不，這是好事。我向前傾得太"}]